Electric’s version of Attachment DPU-1—14 on January 23, 2014, instead of WMECO’s version of the attachment. WMECO’s version is provided herewith. · Attachment DPU-5-9 · Attachment DPU-5-10 · Attachment DPU-5-11 The Company found a systematic formula error with 2011 WMECos End Uses tables. The formula in the original tables subtracted Resource Benefits from Total benefits. The formula should have subtracted non-resource benefits from total benefits. In addition, the Company identified inconsistencies in its 2012 data for the 2012 Multifamily program and the 2012 Low Income 1-4 Family Retrofit program. The revised attachments provide the corrected values for those programs. Hard copies of these exhibits will be distributed at this morning’s evidentiary hearing. Jack Habib",[["12-55-filing-9862.xls","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/dfaibebj?iXEQCHJpK8Ms7OBGI%2BMXPGFJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["12-55-cover-9863.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/dfaibeae?tgnxBrvXJKeQcgVlMDNhr8EmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["12-55-filing-9864.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/dfaibeaj?tgnxBrvXJKeQcgVlMDNhr2FJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["12-55-filing-9865.xls","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/dfaibeje?MniFTH9v5UytwH2A5eaUjMEmiDhMBXK0ednWT8WFP5Ok9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["12-55-filing-9866.xls","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/dfaibejj?MniFTH9v5UytwH2A5eaUjGFJ0ioKRMXdZYr4j7j%2F42qk9v9pxUxyG6LkaCeWBSjqbmMlNqhcSkxPf0qUr1gASPKrYE1qejvebf677PtCVStUdHoHpEGELGLGjR%2BZpYgt"],["12-55-filing-9867.pdf","https://files